(r"If the informed trader gets the one order slot, it knows the synergy class and chooses its order. Market makers see only the order and set the price. The rival sees the price, learns its cost and decides whether to prepare. Preparation shows the rival its value and lets it bid. The incumbent knows its own value and bids it.",
 r"If the informed trader gets the one order slot, it knows the class and chooses its order. Market makers see only the order and set the price. The rival then sees the price, learns its cost and decides whether to prepare. Preparation shows the rival its value and lets it bid, and the incumbent bids its own value."),
